          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.424,
            0.056,
            0.589,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.091,
            0.875,
            0.109
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 了解和掌握蛋白质抗体标记以及在转基因果蝇中表达 GFP 融合蛋白的技术。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.122,
            0.262,
            0.143
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.156,
            0.901,
            0.302
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "果蝇（Drosophila melanogaster）是进行遗传学与细胞生物学分析的一种模式动物。相对于其他单一细胞类型的组织结构，果蝇胚胎含有各种细胞类型的代表，而且体积足够小（"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "500\\mu \\mathrm{m} \\times 100\\mu \\mathrm{m}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "），适用于大量细胞的观察；胚胎的透明度很高，所有细胞都可被观测到。以上特点使得在单个胚胎样品中对各种组织细胞类型进行研究成为可能。此外，与脊椎动物相比，果蝇编码蛋白的基因拷贝数更低。例如，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\alpha"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "-肌动蛋白基因，在果蝇中只有1个，而在脊椎动物中有4个，进一步简化了对特定蛋白质亚细胞定位的分析。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.305,
            0.901,
            0.408
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "虽然果蝇在细胞生物学分析中有很多优势，但也有一些缺陷。①细胞小:例如，一个胚胎表皮细胞直径为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\mu m\\times5\\mu m"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，而脊椎动物的表皮细胞直径是 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mu m\\times20\\mu m"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，对于细胞内不同区间的分析造成困难；②即使蛋白质序列高度保守，但是脊椎动物蛋白的抗体却很难与果蝇中的同源蛋白结合。因此，必须制备专门的抗体用来研究果蝇蛋白质。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.411,
            0.903,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "果蝇胚胎被两种蛋白质层包围:易于剥离的卵壳层或绒毛层，与难剥离且难通透的卵黄膜。用庚烷处理卵黄膜可以使得膜变得通透，允许固定剂进入胚胎。具体方法是加入甲醇形成庚烷-甲醇界面，然后剧烈振荡。胚胎被固定及卵黄膜被剥离后，就可进行抗体标记。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.505,
            0.428,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.539,
            0.903,
            0.601
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）仪器与用具:果蝇培养瓶或罐（250ml 瓶和 30/40ml 罐）、卵收集笼、苹果汁琼脂板、胚胎收集篮、闪烁罐、滚筒、旋转振荡器、载玻片、盖玻片、镊子、A001 号解剖针、针盒（Watkins and Doncaster）、26G"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "^{3/8}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "注射针头、笔刷。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.604,
            0.614,
            0.621
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:黑腹果蝇（Drosophila melanogaster）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.625,
            0.903,
            0.728
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂: 漂白剂、庚烷 (27051-2, Sigma)、甲醇、乙醇、甲醛、多聚甲醛、Triton X-100、NaCl、KCl、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{NaH_2PO_4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Na_2HPO_4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{KH_2PO_4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{MgCl_2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "、EGTA、PIPES (P-8203, Sigma)、SDS (超纯)、甘油、蔗糖、苹果汁 (市售)、琼脂粉 (0140-01, Difco 实验室)、尼泊金 (Nipa 实验室)、酵母 (市售)、Vectashield (H-1000, Vector Labs, Burlingame)、Voltalef H10S Halocarbon oil (Elf Atochem, France)、果蝇培养基。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.732,
            0.904,
            0.791
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1)  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10 \\times \\text{PBS}(1\\text{L})"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " : 80g NaCl（最终浓度为 137mmol/L）、2g KCl（最终浓度为 2.7mmol/L）、14.4g  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "Na_{2}HPO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （最终浓度为 10mmol/L）、2.4g  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "KH_{2}PO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （最终浓度为 2mmol/L）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.796,
            0.903,
            0.834
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在 800ml 蒸馏水中溶解所有组分，加蒸馏水至 1L，用 HCl/NaOH 调 pH 至 7.4，高压灭菌。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.838,
            0.904,
            0.877
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）PBT(500ml)。PBS+0.3% Triton X-100: 50ml 10×PBS、750μl Triton X-100 (0.3%V/V)、0.1g（可选的）叠氮钠，加蒸馏水至500ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.881,
            0.901,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）PBTB(500ml):PBS加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.3\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的Triton "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{X - 100 + 0.5\\%}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的BSA[50ml "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\times"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " PBS、"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 29,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.415,
            0.054,
            0.6,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十二章 其他技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.833,
            0.056,
            0.868,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "237"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.09,
            0.899,
            0.13
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2.5gBSA(0.5%w/V)、750μl Triton X-100(0.3%V/V)、0.1g叠氮钠]，加蒸馏水至500ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.134,
            0.901,
            0.174
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）PB:77.4ml 1mol/L  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "NaH_{2}PO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  和 22.6ml 1mol/L  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "NaH_{2}PO_{4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，用蒸馏水溶解，并加至 1000ml，调节 pH 至 7.4。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.178,
            0.903,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5）PEM(4ml):  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "400\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  1mol/L PIPES(pH6.9),  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  1mol/L  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "MgCl_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  和  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  200mmol/L EGTA(pH8.0)，用 10mol/L KOH 调 pH 至 6.9，最终体积为 4ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.222,
            0.886,
            0.24
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6）4%甲醛 PBS 溶液（100ml）:10ml 10×PBS、10.8ml 37%甲醛、79.2ml 蒸馏水。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.243,
            0.901,
            0.327
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7）苹果汁琼脂板（1.6L）:36g 菌琼脂，1200ml 蒸馏水，在微波炉中加热溶解琼脂至清亮。在微波炉中加热溶解 40g 蔗糖入 400ml 苹果汁中，至清亮。混合两种溶液。当混合液冷却至 60℃，加入 20ml 20% 尼泊金，搅拌，趁还是液体时倒至 5cm/9cm 平板中。凝结后 4℃ 贮存。使用前恢复至室温。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.337,
            0.292,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.371,
            0.576,
            0.39
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（一）制备用于共聚焦显微镜观察的胚胎"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.403,
            0.299,
            0.421
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 饲养果蝇。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.426,
            0.903,
            0.51
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）安装卵收集瓶，底部放一块苹果汁琼脂板，用蜡固定，顶上开一通风口。板中央轻涂  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  酵母膏。保证板中及瓶内没有多余的水汽。把果蝇放入瓶中，在设定的温度下培养（通常是  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "25^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ）。几天之后，雌果蝇开始产卵。每天需更换酵母苹果汁平板至少一次。轻轻将果蝇倒出，快速换板，尽量减少果蝇的飞失。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.512,
            0.299,
            0.529
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 收集胚胎。"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.534,
            0.904,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "放一个新的酵母苹果汁琼脂板在瓶内。每隔适当的时间（如 4h）更换新鲜的琼脂板，形成时间梯度。25℃条件下胚胎的形成大约需 22h，需要注意的是外骨骼在 16h 就开始分泌，使胚胎不易进行抗体标记。温度降至 18℃，发育时间将延长至两倍，因此实际操作中可适当调整温度以便于安排实验时间。胚胎板在 4℃可保存 24h，但是会导致标本的不稳定。过夜收集便于观察果蝇发育的所有时段，但是果蝇胚胎在不同发育阶段的分布通常不均等。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.673,
            0.322,
            0.693
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（二）去绒毛膜"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.706,
            0.849,
            0.725
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "这一步，将从平板中收集胚胎，充分洗涤除去酵母和其余残渣，卵壳被洗去。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.729,
            0.901,
            0.768
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）加约 2ml 水到每个平板，用笔刷轻轻地把胚胎从琼脂中扫出来（果蝇卵通常部分进入琼脂）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.771,
            0.462,
            0.79
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 把胚胎导入洗涤专用网篮中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.794,
            0.903,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）将网篮放入含 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 漂白剂成分（1:1，新配，久置的漂白剂对去卵黄膜步骤造成影响）的洗涤剂中。 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\sim 5\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 后，大多胚胎会浮于表面，这表示去绒毛膜成功。在漂白剂中浸泡时间不能超过 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，否则将破坏内部组织结构。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.858,
            0.401,
            0.876
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）无菌水彻底洗净胚胎。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.88,
            0.545,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 胚胎放于纸巾上稍微晾干。不要太干。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 30,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.055,
            0.185,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "238"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.428,
            0.054,
            0.594,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.099,
            0.44,
            0.119
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（三）标准固定及去卵黄膜"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.132,
            0.903,
            0.172
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）对于每种胚胎样品（不同阶段或基因型）分别使用一个闪烁瓶（做好标记），加 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.8\\mathrm{ml}4\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲醛PBS溶液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.175,
            0.905,
            0.236
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 将胚胎转移到含庚烷的平皿中。用移液管将胚胎和庚烷一起转移到含 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲醛PBS溶液的闪烁瓶中。庚烷的量应该大于或等于固定液。室温下混合 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20 \\sim 30 \\mathrm{~min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", 或者在滚筒或其他装置中混合。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.239,
            0.906,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）用移液管除去瓶底液相物质，再除去庚烷。加入1ml新的庚烷，然后迅速加1～3ml甲醇，剧烈颠倒/振荡1min（如果采用鬼笔环肽对胚胎进行染色，那么在这一步以及接下来的两步中用80%～90%的乙醇代替甲醇）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.303,
            0.906,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）让胚胎静置 10s，然后用移液管将胚胎从瓶底转移到离心管中。在庚烷和甲醇交界面的胚胎是没有去卵黄膜的，因此不能很好地进行染色，应该舍弃。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.346,
            0.906,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（5）用甲醇洗涤3次。每次洗涤，都喷入1ml甲醇以使胚胎散开。胚胎因重力沉降后，除去甲醇（叫做重力洗涤）。胚胎可进行下一步操作，或加1ml甲醇贮存于-20℃中（对于将要用鬼笔环肽染色的样品贮存于100%乙醇中）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.409,
            0.907,
            0.493
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "注意:胚胎可以贮存在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-20^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C甲醇或者乙醇中数个月并成功进行抗体染色。然而，一些抗原及GFP的荧光却因暴露于甲醇或者乙醇中而受到不良影响。这种情况下，应立即进入步骤（四），一些抗体不会识别这种方法固定的抗原，这个时候将有替代方法，在下面步骤（七）中将有描述。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.504,
            0.395,
            0.524
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（四）胚胎的抗体标记"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.538,
            0.907,
            0.599
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 在 PBT(PBS+0.3% Triton X-100) 中洗涤胚胎:先进行 3~5 次快洗，即打入 1ml PBT 分散胚胎，胚胎在重力下沉降，然后吸去 PBT（重力洗涤），再进行一次 15min 的长期洗涤，必须确保洗涤均匀，否则会造成染色不均。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.602,
            0.907,
            0.641
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2)（优化步骤）先在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.1\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " SDS中孵育 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，在PBT中洗3次，将有助于改进某些抗体的染色效果。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.644,
            0.909,
            0.748
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）在 PBTB 中孵育 30min，以封闭非特异结合位点。转移  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （ "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5 \\sim 20\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ）胚胎到 0.5ml 离心管中，需使用宽口移液枪头（可用刀片将枪头的尖部切掉 2mm），吸取胚胎之前，先用一些 PBT 润洗枪头。虽然对胚胎的总量并没有严格要求，但是总体积过大将导致染色不均匀。一般  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "15\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  相当于 100 个胚胎，足够大多数实验分析所需的量。如果需要增加胚胎的数目，则需要更换较大的离心管。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.751,
            0.909,
            0.834
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "250 \\sim 500 \\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  含有稀释一抗的 PBTB 中孵育， "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  过夜。孵育的最适时间取决于抗体和内部组织的染色程度，如果需要内部组织染色充分，则推荐使用更长的孵育时间。一般从室温 2h 到  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  2 天的孵育时间都可以采用。抗体的稀释倍数通常是:抗血清 1:1000，单克隆抗体上清 1:10，根据实际效果调整合适的稀释倍数。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.836,
            0.821,
            0.854
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 用 PBT 洗脱抗体，3～5 次重力洗涤，1～3 次长洗涤（至少 15min）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.858,
            0.908,
            0.897
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（6）与二抗反应:荧光基团偶联的二抗稀释于 PBTB，稀释倍数参照商品建议（通常是 1:100～1:300），室温下 2h 或者 4℃ 过夜。反应时应避光。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 31,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.417,
            0.054,
            0.603,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十二章 其他技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.836,
            0.056,
            0.871,
            0.069
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "239"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.09,
            0.903,
            0.132
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) PBT 洗脱二抗, 3~5 次重力洗涤, 3 次长洗涤 (5~30min 一次), 过夜洗涤也可以。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.143,
            0.485,
            0.163
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（五）用鬼笔环肽标记肌动蛋白"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.175,
            0.873,
            0.194
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 甲醇处理过的胚胎无法用于鬼笔环肽染色，前处理中必须用乙醇代替甲醇。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.197,
            0.904,
            0.237
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）将罗丹明交联的鬼笔环肽溶于甲醇（甲醇损伤的是肌动蛋白，对鬼笔环肽无影响），分装成6份在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-20^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 下储存。使用前，真空干燥然后每份重溶于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mu l"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的PBTB。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.24,
            0.907,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) (四) 中 (1) 和 (2) 步骤完成后即进行以下反应, 如果鬼笔环肽标记与抗体标记联合使用, 则 (四) 中步骤 (3)~(5) 完成后, 进行 (五) 中步骤 (4)。此外鬼笔环肽标记步骤也可与二抗标记步骤, 即 (四) 中 (6) 同时进行。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.304,
            0.907,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）用1份鬼笔环肽孵育 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的胚胎，反应时间 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 以上（"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的鬼笔环肽PBTB溶液 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "+400\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " PBT或者PBTB）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.346,
            0.792,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 用 PBT 洗涤 2 次（如果与二抗同步反应，则需更增加洗涤强度）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.378,
            0.374,
            0.398
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（六）显微制片步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.41,
            0.907,
            0.45
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）洗涤完成后，用 Vectashield 或其他含有抗荧光淬灭成分的甘油基质封片液替换 PBT。胚胎在 Vectashield 中平衡 30min，可在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-20^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  贮存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.453,
            0.911,
            0.6
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）将微量移液枪头（200μl）切口处理，先转移大约5μl Vectashield在枪头中，再吸取胚胎悬液，这样可以减少胚胎与枪头内壁的附着。对于22mm×22mm盖玻片，每个载玻片加20~30μl样品。样品体积越小，胚胎分散平整度越好，但是容易产生气泡。滴加胚胎悬液到载玻片上时，移动枪头使样品涂布于一个稍小于盖玻片面积的正方形区域。用解剖针或微型移液管枪头轻轻分散胚胎使其分布均匀（此步骤并不严格要求，因为当盖玻片压下去，胚胎会自然形成单层分布，但是这步可以减少胚胎之间互相重叠）。每一个载玻片上最佳的胚胎数目取决于实验目的，通常胚胎数不多于30个/片。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.602,
            0.911,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "注意:样品制备过程的关键步骤是固定和去卵黄膜。其他步骤都可根据不同实验室的条件酌情选择。例如，采集卵的方法，抗体标记的试剂，孵育时间和洗涤次数，装片用的介质等。操作时可进行简单的镜检:在（三）步骤（4）或者（四）步骤（1）中，通过解剖镜观察胚胎，如果胚胎依然被透明有光泽的卵黄磷膜包围的话，就需要重新采集胚胎并脱膜。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.719,
            0.562,
            0.739
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（七）胚胎固定与去卵黄膜的替代方案"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.752,
            0.912,
            0.835
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）替代固定液:与前述方法相同，但是将 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:14\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲醛PBS/庚烷，室温下 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\sim 30\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，替换为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:14\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲醛PEM/庚烷，室温 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\sim 30\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:14\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲醛PB/庚烷 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\sim 30\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:137\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲醛/庚烷，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\sim 5\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "25\\sim 37^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，轻轻混合，可以完好地保存细胞骨架结构。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.837,
            0.911,
            0.877
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 热固定: 热固定可增加抗体对晚期胚胎的渗透性（晚期胚胎的外骨骼阻碍抗体渗透）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.88,
            0.912,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）用笔刷把去绒毛膜胚胎转移到闪烁瓶，瓶中含有 1～2ml 0.4% NaCl 与 0.3%"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
